fixture landing_jump_after_kindle_frame_8_ends_it
doc Task 6 core review 2, M1 (the second half); docs/adr/0013, Kindle "from its frame 8 a dash, jump, strike or toss cancels it". Kindle cast high in the air on 10 (its frame 1); a jump pressed on 23 fires on the landing (25, Kindle frame 16) and, like any action from frame 8, ends the spell there. Before the fix a jump fired by the landing never ended it.
room test/flat
option flame 33
frames 40
input
  2 jump
  4 jump
  10 spell
  23 jump
end
expect
  at 10 event.cast=1 spell=kindle
  mark land 20..32 event.land=1
  at land event.jump=1 spell=none
end
